🤔 First – What is Logging?

logging = Writing messages about what your program is doing

Instead of print() →  use logging!

print()   →  just shows on screen, lost forever
logging   →  saves to file, shows level, timestamp, location

Logging is used for:

✅ Track app behaviour
✅ Debug errors in production
✅ Monitor deployments
✅ Audit trail of actions
✅ Alert on critical errors
✅ Troubleshoot issues
